<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Reef Casino  securities reinstated.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Reef Casino  securities reinstated.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Securities in Reef Casino Trust were reinstated at the start of trading on Wednesday, the Australian Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The shares were suspended on January 14 at the request of the manager of the trust. Reef said on January 17 that the trust's manager, Reef Corporate Services Ltd, had agreed on a process to seek additional capital.</p>
<p>Late last month, financiers withdrew a A$15 million facility used to fund high-rolling gambler visits to the casino at Cairns in north Queensland.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
